# Angular conventions

- Standalone components, `changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`, `inject()`, signals, `@if/@for` control flow.
- Zoneless: state that drives the template must be a signal (or `computed`); never rely on zone.js.

## Data

```ts
// ✅ read with httpResource, mutate with ApiService, then reload
protected readonly models = httpResource<DeviceModel[]>(() => '/api/v1/device-models', { defaultValue: [] });

await this.api.createDeviceModel(body);
this.notify.success('บันทึกรุ่นอุปกรณ์แล้ว');
this.models.reload();
```

- Add mutation methods to `core/api.service.ts` (returns `Promise`); do not call `HttpClient` from pages.
- Wrap mutations in try/catch → `this.notify.error(err)`; track `busy` with a signal and disable buttons while busy.
- Destructive actions: `await this.confirm.ask({ ..., danger: true })` first.

## Forms and Syncfusion

- Import `FORM_IMPORTS` and `DIALOG_ANIMATION` from `shared/syncfusion.ts`.
- One signal per field + `computed` validity. Put `[liveValue]="field"` next to `[(value)]` on `ejs-textbox`/`ejs-textarea`
  (Syncfusion only emits on blur).
- Dialogs: `<ejs-dialog [visible]="open()" target="body" [isModal]="true">` with `.form-grid` content; `.full` spans both columns.
- Tables: `<app-data-grid [data] [columns] perspectiveKey exportName [loading] [error] (selectionChange) (retry)>`.
  Long lists (devices, transactions, audit, repair orders) use `[serverPaging]="true"` + `X-Total-Count` + `[exportAll]`.
- Device actions come from `availableActions()` (`core/device-actions.ts`) and `shared/device-action-dialogs.ts`.
- Attachments: `<app-photo-gallery>` for images, `<app-document-list>` for PDF/DOCX/XLSX.
- Backlog bell: `<app-alert-panel>` in the shell; it reads `/dashboard/summary`, do not duplicate the query.

## Text

Thai UI strings inline in templates; status/transaction labels from `core/labels.ts`;
Syncfusion built-in strings from `core/locale.ts` (add missing keys there, never leave English).
